{
 "_comment": [
  "Seeded codeframe for the ABR-HTR wave. Patterns are case-insensitive regexes",
  "matched against the stage-direction-stripped verbatim.",
  "",
  "AUDIO_SENSORY is here for a specific reason: in the prior ABR wave 40-44% of",
  "personas volunteered an audio or sensory complaint and there was no closed-end",
  "option anywhere in the questionnaire that could capture it. A banner built on",
  "the closed-ends alone reported 'not scary, not too long' and missed the single",
  "most consistent negative in the study. Keep it, and keep watching it.",
  "",
  "A codeframe is a hypothesis. tools/04_semantic_themes.py also clusters the",
  "corpus with no codeframe at all and reports clusters this frame fails to cover,",
  "which is how you find the theme nobody thought to seed."
 ],
